## User-to-Campus Assignment

### Architecture

The relationship is stored in `institutionkit_campus_users`:

```sql
CREATE TABLE wp_institutionkit_campus_users (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id BIGINT(20) NOT NULL,
    campus_id INT NOT NULL,
    role VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'campus_admin',
    assigned_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    UNIQUE KEY user_campus (user_id, campus_id)
);
